This is the right place to repeat the boundary between the voice you are hearing now and a meeting record. This movement is newly synthesized editorial speech. It contains no participant quotation and no attendee voice. The separate Listening Archive stays locked: its machine-readable item list is empty, and its transcript and recording fields are null. No raw meetup transcript, audio, video, attributable minutes or quotation is published in this narrated edition. Any future raw release still requires Shaka's specific blessing for that release and every required participant consent. Existing public calls and older open recordings do not unlock a new meeting record. You can download this narration's script, captions and sources because they are editorial artifacts, not because the archive's consent gate has been opened.
